# --- Google Service Account (Sheets + Drive) ---
# Create in Google Cloud Console > IAM & Admin > Service Accounts.
# This ONE service account serves every organization on the platform. Each organization
# shares their own spreadsheets and Drive folder with this address as an Editor — that is
# how their data stays in their Google account while Pro ERP reads and writes it.
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=your-service-account@your-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com
# Paste the full private key from the downloaded JSON, keeping \n escape sequences as-is.
GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nXXXX\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"

# --- Platform registry (multi-tenant) ---
# The ONE spreadsheet Pro ERP itself owns. It holds no business data — only the
# "Organizations" and "Users_Index" tabs mapping each signed-up organization to its own
# System sheet. Create a blank spreadsheet, share it with the service account above as
# Editor, and paste its ID from the URL: /d/<THIS_PART>/edit
# Both tabs and their header rows are created automatically on the first signup.
PLATFORM_SHEET_ID=

# --- Auth ---
# Any long random string. Generate one with: openssl rand -base64 32
JWT_SECRET=

# --- Attachment storage (optional, but the fallback every organization relies on) ---
# Created for you when you add a Blob store in the Vercel dashboard and connect it to
# this project — Vercel injects this variable automatically, you do not paste it by hand.
# Organizations that connect a Shared Drive folder keep their files in their own Drive;
# everyone else (including every free-Gmail account, which Google forbids a service
# account from uploading into) falls back to this store. Without it, those orgs cannot
# attach files at all.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=

# --- Cron (optional) ---
# Any long random string. Set the same value in Vercel's Cron settings (or as an env var).
# A request carrying this secret runs the job for EVERY organization; an admin triggering
# the same route from the UI only ever runs it for their own organization.
CRON_SECRET=
